  "finding": "The current City index identifies Old Town Historic Zone Guidelines (2022) and links a 19-page Historic Old Town Development Standards & Guidelines package. Current Old Town standards/guidelines supersede the isolated one-page 1998 H-1 sheet as a public reference. This is an ABQInfo usefulness/currentness decision, not a claim that historical text ceased to exist or that every provision was individually repealed. The current IDO index provides the operative zoning framework, effective May 6, 2026; application-date qualifications apply."
